type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111126","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111126","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111126.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111126.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-02T20:17:22Z"},"body":"Tested using this script:\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar t1 = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in range(1000):\r\n\t\tget_path()\r\n\tvar t2 = Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tvar delta = t2 - t1\r\n\tprint(\"Took \" + str(delta) + \" usec\")\r\n```\r\nOn a 20 deep node and on a 5 deep node.\r\n\r\nSince the result is cached internally I also removed the cache lookup for testing:\r\n```diff\r\n-if (data.path_cache) {\r\n-\t\treturn *data.path_cache;\r\n-}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis project contains the 20 deep setup: [get_path_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22645464/get_path_test.zip)\r\n\r\nBenchmark:\r\n\r\n|                     | before     | after      |\r\n|---------------------|------------|------------|\r\n| 5 deep (3 samples)  | ~1464 usec | ~625 usec  |\r\n| 20 deep (2 samples) | ~3086 usec | ~1398 usec |\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.